      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated B2B Regulatory, KYB, FinTech & SecOps MCP Server (30 Tools) Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nOfficial Master Model Context Protocol (MCP) Server & Tool Router for all 30 B2B Regulatory, KYB, Sanctions AML, SEC EDGAR, SAM.gov, EU TED, UK FCA, Brazil BCB/PIX/Tax, Healthcare & SecOps engines (@b2b-quant-apis) with Freemium Catalog Discovery and x402 Solana USDC integration.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/b2b-quant-mcp-server](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/b2b-quant-mcp-server)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: b2b-quant-mcp-server** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d3423c7b-571f-5f4d-b4f5-06a647ece31d",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
